WEBVTT

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.980
Great... It's a kid...

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:37.750
It's just some wide-eyed,
flat-chested little kid.

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:43.250
If I treat a sorceress who
can pull off the Dragon Slave...

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:45.660
...like a kid, who knows what
punishment I'll end up eating!

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:49.390
Well, I AM your
protector, after all.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:52.130
Lina-a-a-a!

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:57.740
Just once, can't you
consider MY feelings?

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:03.070
I dunno...
For the rest of my life?

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:09.420
Lina...

00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:17.450
Gourry!

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.490
A dream...

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:35.740
They say "Feed a dog for three days
and you get attached to him," huh?

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:42.640
It's not so surprising. I've been
with Gourry for a year and a half.

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:46.910
We beat the Dark Lord together,
and Copy Rezo, too.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:51.350
We joined a theater group, and
I even got to dress him up like a girl.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:56.450
We've had enough
adventures for three lifetimes.

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:04.530
Maybe I just got used to him
being with me all the time...

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:16.140
But, still... I never thought his
being gone would affect me so much...

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:23.880
Wha? Why am I?

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:41.200
Goo-o-o-d morning!

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:48.970
Are you all right, Miss Lina?

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:54.350
Sure! I'm fine! I had a weird dream
and woke up sort of badly, though.

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:57.080
Hey! Morning combo
for two, please!

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:02.530
Well? What do you
think we should do now?

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:05.430
We won't accomplish anything
just waiting around here.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.090
Hm? That's right...

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:14.740
I've had my innocent
heart cut to shreds here!

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:17.430
I say we find that little
creep Phibrizzo right now and...

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.410
That's not what
we're talking about...

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:21.000
Then what are
you talking about?!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:25.810
Well, when you think about it calmly,
we're facing Hellmaster Phibrizzo...

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.980
...and he's as monstrous
as Monsters come.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.250
Now THIS is the perfect
way to start a morning!

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:35.050
This is all for me,
so no taking any, Gourry...

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:38.290
Miss Lina...

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.100
Lina... You...

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:48.440
You see, I don't
think going there...

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:52.000
...and shooting off a Dragon
Slave is going to save Gourry.

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:56.900
And he never said he'd release
Gourry safely if I went, either...

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:00.550
Which means,
if I just show up...

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:04.650
...he might just kill Gourry
once his purpose had been served.

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:07.750
Now look at it
from the other way.

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:10.260
The safest thing
for Gourry as hostage...

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.490
...would be for
me NOT to go there.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:17.990
So, you see, to just keep on
running and never go to Sairaag...

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:22.010
...would be the
smartest thing to do.

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:27.630
So... You're just
going to leave him there?

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:33.550
Except, the guy IS my protector,
after all, so I can't just ignore him.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:34.710
Then, you're saying?!

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.690
Let's go! To Sairaag!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.380
You're exactly right, Miss Lina!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:41.860
Now that we've decided that,
let's leave right now!

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:46.360
Hold it!
I'm going to Sairaag alone.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.600
Alone... Miss Lina,
did you say alone?!

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.900
It looks like I'm the
only one Hellmaster wants.

00:06:56.980 --> 00:06:59.640
There's no point in having
the rest of you go, too.

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:04.440
You're right. None of us has the
power to even scratch Hellmaster.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.380
If we went with you,
we'd only be in the way.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:08.540
Mr. Zelgadis!

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:11.450
However, if by some miracle
Lina is able to win on her own...

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:14.860
...she'll never let
us hear the end of it.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:19.390
And I find that prospect far worse
than anything Hellmaster might do.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.760
That leaves us
with only one option.

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:25.130
That's right!
We ALL go to Sairaag!

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:29.230
And if we fight with courage and
justice, we'll make our hopes come true!

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.470
Exactly.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:31.870
Zel...

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:35.570
However, before we do, there's
something I want to be made clear.

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:37.670
Hellmaster Phibrizzo's objective.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:42.880
It's clear that he wants to have
you do something for him.

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:44.440
I want Lina to explain what that...

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:45.250
Whoa! Stop!

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:51.260
We don't have to hear
what Phibrizzo's up to.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:52.630
You don't have to hear it?!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.760
You, Amelia?!
Miss Truth and Justice?

00:07:54.830 --> 00:08:01.290
Yes. Look, we know whatever Hellmaster's
up to is for no good, right?

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:02.430
Well, I guess so...

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:07.040
And, if I hear what his plan is, then
I might have to stop you, Miss Lina.

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:09.710
Even if it means
abandoning Mr. Gourry.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:12.510
And I absolutely
don't want to do that!

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:15.420
I see. Then I don't
want to know, either.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.820
Besides, asking won't
affect our enemy either way.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.190
Are you guys sure about this?

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:20.920
It doesn't matter if
we're sure or unsure!

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:24.830
We're ALL going to save Mr. Gourry.
Isn't that reason enough?

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:26.290
Amelia...

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:38.530
Then let's go to Sairaag!
So I can have my revenge!

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:42.970
And maybe to rescue Gourry, too.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:02.430
You needn't worry. I'm sure Lina
and the others will go to Sairaag.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:05.470
And when they do,
that's when the fun will begin.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:08.730
In any case,
I want you to fight Lina.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.470
And put your heart into it!

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:14.200
If you don't, my plan
just isn't going to work.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.580
Fire... BALL!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:32.720
I know she's trying to relieve stress
about what happened to Gourry, but...

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:36.800
Fireball! Fireball!

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.700
Treasure! Treasure!

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:52.080
Now, look...

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.980
Just the thing to treat a
maiden's delicate heart!

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:57.450
I've gotta get my stress level
down before we get to Sairaag...

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:00.050
...so we can save Gourry, right?

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:00.990
Well, I guess, but...

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:04.190
Besides, those guys were crooks!
It's a little punishment for them!

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:06.060
I GUESS it's punishment...

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:08.760
Whoa, looks like there's
someone who wasn't punished yet...

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:11.060
BURST RONDO!

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:13.900
One more time!

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:16.530
No, you don't!

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:23.610
Y- You!

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:26.310
Miss Lina.
Miss Amelia. Mr. Zelgadis...

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:28.250
It's been a while.

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:29.250
Sylphiel?!

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:30.510
Miss Sylphiel!

00:10:30.590 --> 00:10:34.150
You didn't see my white flag?

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:38.360
Wh- What are you doing here?!

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:42.730
I saw the flames and could sense
terrible violence being done.

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:45.230
I thought perhaps two bandit gangs
were fighting each other...

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.670
...and came along to see if anyone
needed to be healed, and then...

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:50.370
...you found yourself on the
wrong end of a Burst Rondo.

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:52.000
Is she an old friend of yours?

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.840
What an awful thing
to have happen!

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:58.310
I thought you were a straggler
from the bandit gang. Sorry.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.280
Oh, like she'll believe THAT.

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:03.510
No, I was careless, too.
By the way, Miss Lina?

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:07.620
I don't see dear Gourry
here with you.

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:10.060
You didn't... Miss Lina,
did you sell him to somebody?!

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:11.920
Uh, now look...

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:15.930
Then did you steal the Sword of
Light and throw him in a river?!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.300
Why are you looking
at me like that?!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.700
Then just where is he?!

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:22.330
G- Gourry's...

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.570
Where is he?!

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:25.300
Gourry's...

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:27.840
...been kidnapped by
Hellmaster Phibrizzo.

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:46.750
So, that's what happened.

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.620
Never mind what I told you.
Anyway, I think it'd be best...

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.930
...for you to go back
to your uncle's place.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:57.940
In other words, Gourry was
taken to lure you to Sairaag?

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.870
Well, yeah. Sort of.

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:04.710
The truth is, I'm on my
way to Sairaag as well.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.040
To... To Sairaag?

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:11.410
I've been hearing strange
things from travelers.

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:15.780
Those who've passed through
Sairaag say the tree has died!

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:18.650
You mean that
gigantic tree there?

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:23.350
Died? Do they mean it
fell or it was cut down?

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:26.660
No, just as they say.
It appears to have died.

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:29.290
Besides that, I hear there's
a city at Sairaag again!

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:30.830
A city?!

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:34.860
The city destroyed when we fought
Copy Rezo? It's back to normal?!

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:37.540
Yes. Do you think it has
something to do with...

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:42.310
...Hellmaster taking dear Gourry
hostage and luring you to Sairaag?

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:43.940
I think it might...

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:46.680
That's why I said I can't
just stay away from this.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:51.120
Then, for dear Gourry, I'll use
violence! Money! Sex appeal!

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:56.150
I'll use any means to rescue
dear Gourry from Hellmaster!

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:58.360
You'll use money and sex
appeal on HELLMASTER?

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:01.090
Let's go, Miss Lina!
To Sairaag!

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:05.000
No use trying to talk
you out of this, huh?

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:14.710
Miss Lina?

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:16.910
If we recover dear
Gourry unharmed...

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:20.280
...I was wondering if I might
travel with you for awhile.

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:22.250
Sure. Why not?

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:23.610
It's all right?

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:28.180
We've already got 5 people in the party.
Having 6 won't be very different.

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:33.290
And what will you do if we rescue
him from Hellmaster, Miss Lina?

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.490
Huh? What else? Claim his
Sword of Light as a reward!

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:38.630
Th- That's not what I meant.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:42.970
Miss Lina, you once told me you
only traveled with dear Gourry...

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:45.270
...for his Sword of Light,
didn't you?

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:46.540
Yeah, I did.

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:50.570
Is that still the reason
you travel together?

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.380
If that's the case, then I...

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:55.980
GET BACK!!!

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.250
Ooh... What's going on?!

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.090
What the?!

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:07.930
Why does this always happen to us?!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:12.800
You should have gotten rid of
the other people, you know.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.370
Phibrizzo!

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:15.460
Miss Lina! Over there!

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:25.620
That's Gourry's...

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:26.710
...Sword of Light!

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:29.650
Now that isn't fair for you to
look down on us so much...

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:33.620
...that you steal Gourry's Sword of
Light for one of your own goons!

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:37.430
Gourry's all right, isn't he?!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.730
Yes, he's fine.
For the moment...

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:43.790
But it was so boring just
waiting around for you.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:46.800
I'm sure the trip must be
dull for you people as well.

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:49.100
That's why I brought
a skilled fighter with me.

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:51.840
I hope he livens
things up for you!

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:54.540
Hmpf! That's help
I'd prefer not to get!

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:56.840
Rescuing Gourry
is our first priority.

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:59.410
So I'll beat your man!

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:02.480
Go! Show them no mercy!

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:05.680
And if someone gets killed,
it's their own bad luck!

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:06.450
Let's go!

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:07.620
Right!

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:09.060
DIS FANG!

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.260
RAH TILT!

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:14.350
GOZU VROW!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:20.670
What?!

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:36.580
The... The Sword of Light's power!
Something's increased it several times!

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:38.350
Miss Lina! Look out!

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:43.650
Miss Lina!

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.690
ELMEKIA LANCE!!!

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:51.830
Miss Lina!

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:55.140
Flare Arrow!

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.200
I see you haven't changed!

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:05.150
I'm the one you're fighting!

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:07.510
BLAST ASH!

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:11.720
Lina!

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:21.890
DAMU BRAS!

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:28.600
DYNAST BRAS!

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:06.770
This guy's good. He can tap the
Sword of Light's power perfectly!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:08.470
I can't believe how good he is...

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.010
Astral Vine...

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:14.180
We'd see a great match-up
if Gourry were here. Too bad.

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:32.800
FLARE... BIT!

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:37.840
BLAM BLAZER!

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:50.610
If he can keep
repelling our spells...

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:53.320
...all we can do is try to keep
dodging the Sword of Light!

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:55.720
I can see how
this is going to end.

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:59.150
Normal methods won't
let you beat him.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.490
You're going to have to fight
more seriously against him.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.100
Guys, run!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:20.510
I hate this!

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.210
"...all the fools who stand
in our way be destroyed..."

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:32.090
"...by the power you and
I possess!" DRAGON SLAVE!!!

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:38.870
He absorbed it with
the Sword of Light?!

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.650
The Dragon Slave is no good.

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:01.850
And the Ragna Blade won't work
against someone as fast as he is!

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:08.360
That other spell is too powerful for
the Sword of Light to absorb. But!

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:28.710
Wha? You!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:33.480
I see you're up to your neck
in trouble, as usual.

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:34.720
It's him!

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:35.850
Mr. Zangulus!

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:37.490
What are you doing here?!

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:39.260
Where is Gourry?

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:43.430
Don't tell me you've just
been following Gourry!

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:44.900
Get off my back!

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:49.570
Well, Gourry isn't here, but there's a
great swordsman who's perfect for you!

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:51.230
And he's got
Gourry's Sword of Light!

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:52.680
So it would seem...

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:55.540
Howling Sword... PART TWO!

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:02.680
The feel of that strike!

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:07.890
Can it be him?!

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:12.820
Zangulus! Get back!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:16.260
"Power that can smash
even the souls of the gods!"

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:18.160
RAGNA BLADE!!!

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:21.330
Now that he's stopped,
I can slash him!

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:35.050
Miss Lina!

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:35.980
Lina!

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:39.810
Look! His mask!

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:48.960
Gourry!

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.700
Gourry dear!

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:51.830
Gourry?

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:57.370
It... It can't be...

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:00.970
GOURRY!!!
